{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits","id":1082644,"title":"Awakening Spriits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-23T09:08:41-07:00","id":1082644,"title":"Awakening Spriits","content":"1st Ed had a spirit spell that let you awaken the spirit of an item, basically a more powerful version of Coax Spirit, but bringing the spirit to full activity. The closest thing I can find in 2 ed,, &quot;Rouse Spririt&quot; is only used to reawaken hibernating spirits. How would I go about awakening / empowering the spirit of my sanctum (possibly to act as a guardian) in a situation where it there is no hibernating spirit to rouse? I'm assuming it is not a given that every structure (especially relatively new ones) has an active spirit associated with it (and so no guarantee said spirit will be hibernating in it now).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","name":"Newes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T09:22:35-07:00","id":1082653,"title":"","content":"A spirit never has to have been awake before in order for Rouse Spirit to work on it, so Rouse Spirit is what you would use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T17:11:51-07:00","id":1082838,"title":"","content":"Also, a Master can always create one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T17:44:03-07:00","id":1082851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits?p=1082838#post1082838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, a Master can always create one.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's existence would be tied to Duration though and it could be dispelled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T18:23:10-07:00","id":1082859,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits?p=1082851#post1082851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's existence would be tied to Duration though and it could be dispelled.</div> </div> </div> </div>Archmasters will tell you this is a good thing. They may have a point. <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">:P</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">(More seriously, this is also part of the case to be made for spells Withstanding dispellation with their Practice's dot rating rather than their creators' Arcanum rating, as well as one of those things for which Advanced Potency is especially worthwhile.)</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T23:30:09-07:00","id":1082912,"title":"","content":"Anyone now of any sample spirits statlines you could use as inspiration for this? Rouse Spirit states that the Potency of the spell needs to be equal to the Spirits Corpus - its current essence, but I frankly have no clue what either number would be for say a 30 year old two story semi-detached house?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T00:07:02-07:00","id":1082921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katana1515</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits?p=1082912#post1082912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone now of any sample spirits statlines you could use as inspiration for this? Rouse Spirit states that the Potency of the spell needs to be equal to the Spirits Corpus - its current essence, but I frankly have no clue what either number would be for say a 30 year old two story semi-detached house?</div> </div> </div> </div>How important is the house, spiritually speaking? How much emotional investment does the house's tenants and bystanders give to the house? Generally speaking, a spiritually &quot;charged&quot; house would be Rank 2. A rather unremarkable and thus less spiritual house might be Rank 1. A house where entire generations lived, and is known by the entire neighborhood might be Rank 3. From there you can pick any number you fancy from the Attribute and trait ranges for that Rank. (It's in the section handling ephemeral entities)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T05:19:26-07:00","id":1082977,"title":"","content":"Thanks, thats a good answer!<br /> One thing I would still be unsure of is how much Essence such a spirit is likely to have stored in its pattern? Assume we have the unremarkable Rank 1 House Spirit, thats never been animated or self aware before. Would it have any essence at all? Could I pump it up with essence in advance to make the casting easier?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6230,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","user":"Katana1515","date":".  another question. 04-24-2017, 08:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T06:04:18-07:00","id":1082988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katana1515</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits?p=1082977#post1082977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks, thats a good answer!<br /> One thing I would still be unsure of is how much Essence such a spirit is likely to have stored in its pattern? Assume we have the unremarkable Rank 1 House Spirit, thats never been animated or self aware before. Would it have any essence at all? Could I pump it up with essence in advance to make the casting easier?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depending on how well the house spirit is doing at keeping up with generating any essence it needs, it could be rolling in essence. Since i assume house spirits dont usually move, they might also try to lure in other spirits to munch on, or eat any that spawn inside.<br /> <br /> A new rank 1 spirit id say it probably has to start feeding on whatever essence the resonance the house is, if the house isnt generating essence (new builds maybe?) then it might have to resort to trying to lure in other rank 1 spirits. Yeh not moving might make it tricky so id say it may not have loads of essence but to be honest, choose whatever you think the story needs. If you want it to be easier for the players have it have loads of essence, it you want to give them more of a challenge have it be on the verge of having to go back into hibernation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T06:40:22-07:00","id":1082992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>totalgit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits?p=1082988#post1082988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Depending on how well the house spirit is doing at keeping up with generating any essence it needs, it could be rolling in essence. Since i assume house spirits dont usually move, they might also try to lure in other spirits to munch on, or eat any that spawn inside.<br /> <br /> A new rank 1 spirit id say it probably has to start feeding on whatever essence the resonance the house is, if the house isnt generating essence (new builds maybe?) then it might have to resort to trying to lure in other rank 1 spirits. Yeh not moving might make it tricky so id say it may not have loads of essence but to be honest, choose whatever you think the story needs. If you want it to be easier for the players have it have loads of essence, it you want to give them more of a challenge have it be on the verge of having to go back into hibernation</div> </div> </div> </div>OP and the rest of this thread is built on the presumption that any spirits in question are -already- hibernating and therefore not active. So this helps how?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T09:21:38-07:00","id":1083047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits?p=1082992#post1082992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> OP and the rest of this thread is built on the presumption that any spirits in question are -already- hibernating and therefore not active. So this helps how?</div> </div> </div> </div>Im saying he can fudge how hard it is to awaken the spirit? If its already hibernating then it has essence 0 and corpus = size (house) + resistance (1-5) for rank 1, he then asked how to go about empowering it and just mentioned that house spirits probably have a harder time getting essence if theres no resonance in them which one can assume if its hibernating and was active before. If he wants to keep it around as a guardian spirit, he'll need to make sure it has a source of essence, or feed it himself? (unlike mor emobile spirits who you can probably leave to their own to feed themselves)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> OP and the rest of this thread is built on the presumption that any spirits in question are -already- hibernating and therefore not active. So this helps how? </div> </div> </div>How did this help?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1534,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","user":"totalgit","date":". 04-24-2017, 12:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T14:39:39-07:00","id":1083188,"title":"","content":"Referring back to the first respondant, if an item of whatever size or age somehow has a dormant spirit that has never been awake, wouldn't said spirit always default to rank 1?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","name":"Newes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T14:54:33-07:00","id":1083194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits?p=1083188#post1083188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Referring back to the first respondant, if an item of whatever size or age somehow has a dormant spirit that has never been awake, wouldn't said spirit always default to rank 1?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, or even lower than rank 1 and just be a mote (i think they are called) if really small, coins maybe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T19:58:34-07:00","id":1083282,"title":"","content":"If it's never awakened it would likely be Rank 0. Mages might call them motes.<br /> <br /> 'Muthra are barely formed, new-born spirits, with no minds of their own and no rank in the umia. They aren\u2019t even powerful enough to awaken from dormancy, and simply settle in the Hisil close to a source of Essence. Other spirits feed on them with no more care than a human shows toward fruit.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T08:04:47-07:00","id":1083456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits?p=1083282#post1083282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it's never awakened it would likely be Rank 0. Mages might call them motes.<br /> <br /> 'Muthra are barely formed, new-born spirits, with no minds of their own and no rank in the umia. They aren\u2019t even powerful enough to awaken from dormancy, and simply settle in the Hisil close to a source of Essence. Other spirits feed on them with no more care than a human shows toward fruit.'</div> </div> </div> </div>So how would Rouse Spirit work on such? I guess once one figured out how it worked he would need to use Bolster spirit to raise it to rank 1 at least ...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","name":"Newes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T08:07:44-07:00","id":1083458,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1082644-awakening-spriits?p=1083456#post1083456\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So how would Rouse Spirit work on such? I guess once one figured out how it worked he would need to use Bolster spirit to raise it to rank 1 at least ...</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. A Rank 0 spirit has no Attributes, Numina, or Influence so it would be useless to work with unless you enhanced it. In that case you'd treat it as a Rank 1 or other spirit, depending on how much you enhanced it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}